    "description": "<p>Nokia&#8217;s applied research team has open-sourced AnyJev, a Python library that turns an open LLM into a decision model. It needs no training. It targets a common production job: picking one answer from a fixed set instead of writing a sentence. Is it deployable? Yes, it installs from PyPI, ships under Apache-2.0, and has transformers [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/09/23/nokia-open-sources-anyjev-a-training-free-layer-that-turns-any-open-llm-into-a-cal...",
